WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
- And what people don't get as well

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.000
is I have a couple friends too

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.602
it takes them like five hours

00:00:06.602 --> 00:00:09.000
to press out their hair, their curls.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.605
Like, my friend Ava, I'm like,

00:00:10.605 --> 00:00:12.625
"Are you still in the bathroom?"

00:00:12.625 --> 00:00:13.458
- Yes!

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:15.140
- "Like how are you
still in the bathroom?"

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.990
and she's like, "Girl, it
takes me forever to get it. "

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.510
and I'm like, "Gaw!"

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.420
- Girl, that was me at 1:00 a.m.,

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.410
pressing my hair.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.382
My momma knows I was
pressing my hair everyday.

00:00:23.382 --> 00:00:26.920
Not only the time but the resources.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.750
The wigs that women have to buy

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.260
just so that they have the straight hair.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.093
The weaves.

00:00:31.093 --> 00:00:32.640
Like we're talking about
a lot of money that puts-

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:33.691
- I do wear weaves.

00:00:33.691 --> 00:00:34.731
- I do too.

00:00:34.731 --> 00:00:35.564
- several people at a disadvantage.

00:00:35.564 --> 00:00:37.940
- But do you always wear naturally now?

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.980
- I do. You know it's very rare

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.230
when I straighten my hair.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:42.650
And I think

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:43.483
going through that

00:00:43.483 --> 00:00:44.440
experience I told you about,

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.220
I think it's just made
me so much more proud

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.390
of who I am and it also reminded me

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:49.660
of the position that I'm in

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.620
that hopefully I can inspire young girls,

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:55.040
young girls of color,
white girls, brown girls,

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.500
every king of girl out there who is

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.720
feeling ashamed of some
part of who they are

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.500
and what they were given by God.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.690
I don't want them to feel that.

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:06.770
And so I hope that whenever
I rock my curls on the air,

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:08.230
there's one more little girl out there

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:09.830
who's encouraged to do the same.

